incorporation_legal_framework.pro_forma_first_board_resolution_en:
RESOLVED, that the subscription of 100 common shares, par value USD 100 each, drawn from the authorized capital of USD 10,000, be and hereby is ratified and issued to the founding subscriber at par;
RESOLVED FURTHER, that the registered office of the Company be and hereby is established at the office of the resident agent [Name and address], and the resident agent is confirmed as statutory agent for service of process;
RESOLVED FURTHER, that [Name] be and hereby is appointed President, [Name] Secretary and [Name] Treasurer, each to serve until the next annual general meeting;
RESOLVED FURTHER, that the officers are authorized to execute banking, tax (RUC), municipal licensing and e-commerce registration documents.
